            </t>
            <t id="" index="349" hasRuby="0" torder="1" vertical="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:02,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:07,400</end-time>
                <translation>我们就会想那样的话不向海外提供那么多援助不也行吗</translation>
