            <t id="" index="350" hasRuby="0" torder="1" vertical="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:07,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:12,275</end-time>
                <translation>我觉得很多人可能已经产生了这样的感觉</translation>
                <original>いう感覚にまああの結構なっているんじゃないかと思うんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" index="351" hasRuby="0" torder="1" vertical="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:12,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:15,700</end-time>
